{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guizi Must Dead is a historical FPS with Tarkov-like gameplay and survival base-building. Infiltrate enemy lines, loot supplies, fight foes, and extract safely. Use resources to farm and fortify your base. Inspired by WWII guerrilla resistance, supports up to 4-player co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tarkov-like guerrilla warfare.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a guerrilla fighter, ambush enemy convoys to seize supplies, and escape successfully from enemy encirclement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309070/extras/4e61023c7f77c19dc45abbd6e026aef1.poster.avif?t=1770891652\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309070/extras/4e61023c7f77c19dc45abbd6e026aef1.webm?t=1770891652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309070/extras/4e61023c7f77c19dc45abbd6e026aef1.mp4?t=1770891652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Diverse weapons system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >including the dadao (Chinese broadsword), the Mauser C96, the Kar98k, the MP40, the PPSh-41, and other classic WWII weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also obtain powerful period weapons through black-market dealers and by reproducing them from blueprints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All weapons can be upgraded at your base \u2014 for example, the Mauser C96 (broomhandle) can be fitted with a fire-selector to convert it to fully automatic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309070/extras/3fe3c4c37d85244db8561b69c0eae553.poster.avif?t=1770891652\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309070/extras/3fe3c4c37d85244db8561b69c0eae553.webm?t=1770891652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309070/extras/3fe3c4c37d85244db8561b69c0eae553.mp4?t=1770891652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Base building and farming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be self-sufficient \u2014 build and expand your base and farm to secure food.<br>Raise livestock for meat; animal manure can be processed into fertilizer to improve your fields.<br>Cooked food restores health and grants temporary attribute boosts.<br>Your base can also mine and smelt ore, and use recovered weapon blueprints to manufacture and upgrade firearms and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309070/extras/ba3b5e46463b6806860538330b40f785.poster.avif?t=1770891652\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309070/extras/ba3b5e46463b6806860538330b40f785.webm?t=1770891652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309070/extras/ba3b5e46463b6806860538330b40f785.mp4?t=1770891652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3309070?t=1770891652","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3309070?t=1770891652","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309070/d63f37c328b63b8d4d8dd3e646c69fde366ba58f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770891652","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309070/d63f37c328b63b8d4d8dd3e646c69fde366ba58f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770891652","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guizi Must Dead is a historical FPS with Tarkov-like gameplay and survival base-building. Infiltrate enemy lines, loot supplies, fight foes, and extract safely. Use resources to farm and fortify your base. Inspired by WWII guerrilla resistance, supports up to 4-player co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tarkov-like guerrilla warfare.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a guerrilla fighter, ambush enemy convoys to seize supplies, and escape successfully from enemy encirclement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309070/extras/4e61023c7f77c19dc45abbd6e026aef1.poster.avif?t=1770891652\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309070/extras/4e61023c7f77c19dc45abbd6e026aef1.webm?t=1770891652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309070/extras/4e61023c7f77c19dc45abbd6e026aef1.mp4?t=1770891652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Diverse weapons system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >including the dadao (Chinese broadsword), the Mauser C96, the Kar98k, the MP40, the PPSh-41, and other classic WWII weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also obtain powerful period weapons through black-market dealers and by reproducing them from blueprints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All weapons can be upgraded at your base \u2014 for example, the Mauser C96 (broomhandle) can be fitted with a fire-selector to convert it to fully automatic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309070/extras/3fe3c4c37d85244db8561b69c0eae553.poster.avif?t=1770891652\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309070/extras/3fe3c4c37d85244db8561b69c0eae553.webm?t=1770891652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309070/extras/3fe3c4c37d85244db8561b69c0eae553.mp4?t=1770891652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Base building and farming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be self-sufficient \u2014 build and expand your base and farm to secure food.<br>Raise livestock for meat; animal manure can be processed into fertilizer to improve your fields.<br>Cooked food restores health and grants temporary attribute boosts.<br>Your base can also mine and smelt ore, and use recovered weapon blueprints to manufacture and upgrade firearms and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309070/extras/ba3b5e46463b6806860538330b40f785.poster.avif?t=1770891652\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309070/extras/ba3b5e46463b6806860538330b40f785.webm?t=1770891652\" type=\"video/webm; codec